osku@mpoli.fi (Osku Salerma) writes:

>What artifact can you find on the town? I've been there dozens of times
>and haven't noticed anything..

	There isn't an artifact just sitting around, but there is something
there which can help you *get* an artifact.  Small spoiler ahead...

	The town level is guaranteed to have an altar.  Altars can help you
get an artifact.  Another small spoiler ahead.....

	By #offering fresh enemy corpses on altars of your own god, you will
eventually be granted an artifact weapon.  Be careful of offering on altars
not of your own god, though....(yet another small spoiler)

	If you #offer on an altar not of your god's, two things can happen:

1) The altar is converted over to your god.  If this altar is attended by 
priest of the former alignment, he/she naturally isn't going to like it and
will attack you.

2) The conversion fails, which is unlucky for you.

